# Normalize line endings regardless of core.autocrlf on the checkout machine.
# A workstation with autocrlf=true (the git-for-windows default) otherwise
# checks text files out with CRLF, which some tools reject as control
# characters in scripts they read directly (e.g. Workflow's scriptPath).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.js text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
